# The dictionaries — [Freq] JPDB, [Bilingual] JMdict, [Kanji] JPDB — are the author's
# local copies and hundreds of megabytes besides. build-freq.py reads them from here and
# commits only what it distils. The brackets are escaped because git otherwise reads
# [Freq] as "one of F, r, e or q".
